<title>USA: CBOT full membership sells for record $775,001.</title>
<headline>CBOT full membership sells for record $775,001.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade said a full membership sold April 8 for a record $775,001.</p>
<p>The new high price exceeds the prior record of $750,000 set March 11.</p>
<p>The current bid price is $775,000 for a full seat, which is offered for sale at $875,000.</p>
<p>A full CBOT membership allows its holder to trade all CBOT contracts.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750)) E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
